# add_observer.rules - add_observer/02_setup_observer_host.sh, 03_observer_ctl.sh (third host)
Observer database username \(SYSDG\) \[[^]]*\]:	@OBSERVER_USER@
TNS alias for the PRIMARY \[[^]]*\]:	@PRIMARY_ALIAS@
TNS alias for the STANDBY \[[^]]*\]:	@STANDBY_ALIAS@
Database password for [^:\n]*:	@OBSERVER_PASSWORD@	secret
Enter a NEW wallet password \(protects the wallet file itself\):	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Confirm wallet password:	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Enter the existing wallet password for [^:\n]*:	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Back up [^\n]* and build a fresh wallet\? \[y/N\]:	y
Add the observer credentials to the EXISTING wallet \(answer No to rebuild it\)\? \[y/N\]:	y
Continue anyway\? \[y/N\]:	y
Kill them\? \[y/N\]:	y
